msgstr "புதிய பரிசு அட்டையை உருவாக்கவும்"

#: eventyay/control/templates/pretixcontrol/order/refund_choose.html:134
msgid ""
"The gift card can be used to buy tickets for all events of this organizer."
msgstr ""
